"The felled god Valrok boasts of was the Nameless Hell Hound's father, a god-tier Hell Hound."
"Transmigrators can ascend to godhood, though few ever come near it."
"The System grants a hidden achievement for killing another transmigrator, and hints it will matter."
"That achievement's reward shows only as garbled text, as the System's own words break."
"The same garbled text appeared once before, when the Nameless Hell Hound was nearly burned alive."
"The Nameless Hell Hound must seek the Serpent of the Black Pyre to unlock a fire-witch Path."
"An Earth transmigrator reborn as a talking skeleton gathered Divine Dross in the Cursed City."
"She meant to test the Dross on the Nameless Hell Hound before the Hound killed her."
